# A committed TEMPLATE of .github/c2-serving-job.env for the tp4/packed-prefix development window (sticky sessions on the eight-seat 262k packed path;
# scripts/ci/c2_serving_job.py parses it): copy it over .github/c2-serving-job.env on a throwaway commit of tp4/packed-prefix and push a tag
# experiment/c2-serving-vN. Nothing here names a rig, a card, a host or a registry: the cards are resolved at run time. The jobs are templates only: no tag is
# pushed from this branch by its author.
# ONE IMAGE FOR THE WHOLE WINDOW: C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-packed-prefix-1 is what B0 builds from the pushed tp4/packed-prefix commit; every later job serves that one image. A commit of a
# file the image carries needs a new B0 build and a new tag in every template. The cards are under development: this window never stops, starts or hands back the node agent.
# E1: EXACTNESS against a cold prefill, the full eager set on the audited sticky arm: the chained real-text conversation 6k -> the prompt limit (through 72k..120k and 150k, 200k to the 262k window's prompt
# limit), every turn run cold under a fresh salt and again as a hit, compared in full (output tokens and the rows' slot and logits digests); the changed-suffix and early-divergence forks; the boundaries
# 2047/2048/2049 and 4095/4096/4097; one tenant's siblings sharing the system block. STRICT: the fast path is batch invariant, so every pair must be IDENTICAL; a preempted request is a FAIL. Every Q,
# h and capture plan is checked against the sticky oracle; no row may compile a program after its cold twin. Duration (estimate): 150-240 min. Stop rule: any DIVERGED pair stops the window.
C2_CARDS=quad
C2_ACTIONS=reset prefix
C2_IMAGE_TAG=tp4-packed-prefix-1
C2_PREFIX_PLAN=exactness-eager
C2_PREFIX_PROFILE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-prefix-gate
C2_PREFIX_BASELINE=c2-packed-tp4-8x262k-best
